#@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
#@type = "zendesk.api"

Feature: EE Routing
	Testing the routing of specific tickets to EE user groups

Setup:
	* I get all test passwords and admin emails

Teardown:
	* I teardown the tickets with ticketIds "${staticRequestIdList}" from zendesk.liferay.com
	* I teardown users with the following userExternalIds from zendesk.liferay.com
	| User1 |
	* I teardown organizations with the following organizationExternalIds from zendesk.liferay.com
	| 12345678 |
	#Necessary pause after the teardown and the next test execution
	* I wait for "3" seconds

Scenario: EE CN CN Routing
	Tickets created in the CN region with the escalation_engineer tag should be assigned to the EE - CN group.

	Given I create an organization with the following values
	| Status           | Approved            |
	| Name             | Organization Name 1 |
	| Shared Tickets   | true                |
	| Shared Comments  | true                |
	| SLA              | Gold                |
	| Tier             | T4                  |
	| Support Region   | China               |
	| Support Language | Chinese             |
	| External ID      | 12345678            |
	And I assign an organization with organizationExternalId "12345678" with the following tags
	| liferay_dxp |
	And I create a user with the following values
	| Name             | Zendesk User1                    |
	| Tags             | osb_customer,osb_kb              |
	| Password         | ${staticZendeskAdminPassword}    |
	| Role             | End-user                         |
	| Access           | Organization                     |
	| Email            | zendesk.user1@zendesk.com.broken |
	| Phone Number     | +1 (555) 555-5555                |
	| Organization     | Organization Name 1              |
	| Language         | Chinese                          |
	| Time Zone        | Beijing                          | 
	| External ID      | User1                            |
	And I create a request as a user with the email address "zendesk.user1@zendesk.com.broken" with the following values
	| Product                  | prd_liferay_dxp_7_4                              |
	| Component                | activation_key_project_administration            |
	| Tags                     | escalation_engineer                              |
	| System Status            | production_functioning_with_limited_capabilities |
	| Subject                  | Request Subject                                  |
	| Description              | Request Description                              |
	| Organization External ID | 12345678                                         |
	Then the tickets with ticketIds "${staticRequestIdList}" should be assigned to the group "EE - CN"
	And the ticket with the ticketId "${staticRequestIdList}" should be set to the "CN" support schedule

